hat We’re Looking For</h3></br><ul><li>Significant experience leading commercial construction projects, including work at the Project Executive, Director, or senior Project Manager level.</li><li>A background in design-build delivery and the ability to work effectively with in-house design and construction teams.</li><li>Experience overseeing large, complex projects, ideally in the $30 million to $100 million-plus range.</li><li>A strong record of developing project teams and building lasting client relationships.</li><li>The judgment and communication skills to lead at both the project and team level.</li></ul></br><h3>What’s Offered</h3></br><ul><li>Base salary up to $200,000, depending on experience.</li><li>Hybrid flexibility, with up to two days working from home.</li><li>Leadership responsibility across significant national projects, without regular travel.</li><li>The opportunity to shape and develop a growing Chicago project team.</li><li>An established company with more than 70 years of design-build experience.</li><li>A collaborative, integrated team with architecture, design, and construction capabilities in-house.</li></ul>#J-18808-Ljbffr</p> ]]>
