ursue additional opportunities with UPS</p><p>This job posting includes information about the minimum qualifications, including the UPS Appearance Guidelines, locations, shifts, and operations within the locations that may consider your application. An applicant or employee may request an exception, change, or accommodation for any condition of employment, including the UPS Appearance Guidelines.<em></em></p><p><em><strong>The base pay for this position is $36.00/hour</strong><br /></em></p><p></p> <p>UPS is committed to providing a workplace free of discrimination, harassment, and retaliation. UPS is an equal opportunity employer. UPS does not discriminate on the basis of race/color/religion/sex/national origin/veteran/disability/age/sexual orientation/gender identity or any other characteristic protected by law.</p></p> ]]>
